  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fortalecimiento a la Revitalizacin de Barrios Patrimoniales e Infraestructura Segura e Inclusiva</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Revitalization of Heritage Neighborhoods and Safe and Inclusive Infrastructure</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es contribuir a la revitalizacin y gestin segura e inclusiva de los Barrios Patrimoniales Emblemticos (BPE). Los objetivos especficos son: (i) fortalecer las capacidades tcnicas y de gestin de los municipios, con nfasis en resiliencia e inclusin; (ii) contribuir con la reactivacin econmica y la integracin sociocultural en los BPE, incluyendo hogares nacionales y migrantes; y (iii) revitalizar la infraestructura de los BPE incluyendo consideraciones de migracin, resiliencia, seguridad y gnero</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to contribute to the revitalization and safe and inclusive management of Iconic Heritage Neighborhoods (BPEs). The specific objectives are: (i) to strengthen the technical and management capacities of municipalities, with an emphasis on resilience and inclusion; (ii) to contribute to economic reactivation and sociocultural integration in the BPEs, including national and migrant households; and (iii) to revitalize the infrastructure of the BPEs including migration, resilience, security and gender considerations.</narrative>
  </description>
